{
  "name": "Build a vehicle deal sheet from a VIN with Auto.dev",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Build a vehicle deal sheet from a VIN\n\n### How it works\nFor dealers, brokers and lenders who quote a car to a buyer. A form takes the VIN, sale price, the buyer's ZIP code, down payment and credit score. The workflow decodes the VIN, calculates the monthly payment with taxes and fees for that ZIP code, gets loan rates for 36 to 84 month terms at that credit score, and estimates the five-year cost to own. The result is shown as a one-page deal sheet when the form is submitted.\n\nRates and costs are estimates for quoting, not a lender's offer. Ownership cost is not available for every vehicle (older models, for example); the deal sheet says so and still shows the rest.\n\n### Setup\n1. This template uses the community node `n8n-nodes-autodev` (tested with version 0.1.0 on n8n 2.47). It needs a self-hosted n8n until the node is verified. Install it from **Settings > Community Nodes** ([guide](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/community-nodes/installation/)).\n2. Create an **Auto.dev API** credential with a key from [auto.dev](https://www.auto.dev/dashboard/api-keys). Payments, interest rates and ownership cost need the Growth plan or higher. The run makes four API requests.\n3. Select the credential in the four Auto.dev nodes.\n4. Activate the workflow and open the form's production URL from **Deal sheet request**.\n\n### Customization\nAdd a Gmail or Outlook node after **Build the deal sheet** to email it to the buyer. Write each quote to your CRM or a Google Sheet. Change the loan term in **Calculate the loan payment**.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 520
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "62814a28-cb7a-4b1d-ac89-d79b1b66f01e",
      "name": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Take the request\nA form collects the VIN and the buyer's numbers.",
        "height": 130,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -180,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "4a756dba-5e4e-411d-be25-d53d96bb36da",
      "name": "Note input"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Price the deal\nDecodes the VIN, then gets the payment, loan rates by term and five-year cost to own.",
        "height": 130,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "08543a45-5ea2-4837-9fff-728d19f032c5",
      "name": "Note data"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Show the deal sheet\nPuts the numbers on one page for the buyer.",
        "height": 130,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "81ea2824-e672-4b23-87f2-bf960ea0f704",
      "name": "Note out"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Vehicle deal sheet",
        "formDescription": "Enter a VIN and the buyer's numbers to get the payment, loan rates and five-year cost.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "VIN",
              "placeholder": "1HGCM82633A004352",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Price",
              "fieldType": "number",
              "placeholder": "25000",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "ZIP",
              "placeholder": "33132",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Down payment",
              "fieldType": "number",
              "placeholder": "3000",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Credit score",
              "placeholder": "720",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -100,
        40
      ],
      "id": "f24f167b-0efd-4e3a-bd9e-587821fb6475",
      "name": "Deal sheet request"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "vin",
        "operation": "decode",
        "vin": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json.VIN }}",
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-autodev.autoDev",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        40
      ],
      "id": "094e8414-231d-4366-9e34-52f422ea0103",
      "name": "Decode the VIN"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "finance",
        "operation": "getPayments",
        "vin": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json.VIN }}",
        "options": {
          "price": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json.Price }}",
          "zip": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json.ZIP }}",
          "downPayment": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json['Down payment'] }}",
          "creditScore": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json['Credit score'] }}"
        },
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-autodev.autoDev",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        40
      ],
      "id": "8068ada8-758e-4321-beb8-45b840fa8fd8",
      "name": "Calculate the loan payment"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "finance",
        "operation": "getInterestRates",
        "vin": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json.VIN }}",
        "options": {
          "creditScore": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json['Credit score'] }}",
          "zip": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json.ZIP }}"
        },
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-autodev.autoDev",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        40
      ],
      "id": "b79ea805-df51-4baf-b80b-57eeb7ba97c9",
      "name": "Get loan rates by term"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "finance",
        "operation": "getOwnershipCost",
        "vin": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json.VIN }}",
        "options": {
          "zip": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json.ZIP }}"
        },
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-autodev.autoDev",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        40
      ],
      "id": "f4b23c94-9e9d-4ae8-b25d-a0a741d3bea4",
      "name": "Get five-year ownership cost",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d01e1caa-1305-404f-acf5-2744390c6053",
              "name": "vehicle",
              "value": "={{ $('Decode the VIN').item.json.year }} {{ $('Decode the VIN').item.json.make }} {{ $('Decode the VIN').item.json.model }} {{ $('Decode the VIN').item.json.trim }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a87f881b-67b8-4f9a-a686-69955baa383e",
              "name": "price",
              "value": "={{ $('Deal sheet request').item.json.Price }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "2f47cafd-16b9-4291-9237-2b03d08ff8b7",
              "name": "monthlyPayment",
              "value": "={{ $('Calculate the loan payment').item.json.paymentsData.loanMonthlyPaymentWithTaxes }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "6661f815-15a8-48fd-8c4c-736c7bb3768e",
              "name": "loanAmount",
              "value": "={{ $('Calculate the loan payment').item.json.paymentsData.loanAmount }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "86834d5f-7c70-4ac3-a11c-3b2ed0cf1626",
              "name": "taxesAndFees",
              "value": "={{ $('Calculate the loan payment').item.json.paymentsData.totalTaxesAndFees }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "47f478cb-edb7-4011-bb35-224f3410cff7",
              "name": "term",
              "value": "={{ $('Calculate the loan payment').item.json.paymentsData.calculationCriteria.numberOfMonths }} months at {{ $('Calculate the loan payment').item.json.paymentsData.calculationCriteria.financeRate }}%",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c33dd0c0-9f94-40d5-a998-301642e400e6",
              "name": "rates",
              "value": "={{ Object.entries($('Get loan rates by term').item.json.apr || {}).map(([months, rate]) => months + ' months: ' + rate + '%').join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bdfec8bc-5cc1-4c9d-86f8-06060279138c",
              "name": "fiveYearCost",
              "value": "={{ $json.tco ? '$' + $json.tco.total.tcoPrice + ' ($' + $json.tco.total.averageCostPerMile + ' per mile)' : 'not available for this vehicle' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1180,
        40
      ],
      "id": "03f9e486-5abc-4e38-b06f-822c0601b2ab",
      "name": "Build the deal sheet"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "completion",
        "completionTitle": "=Deal sheet: {{ $json.vehicle }}",
        "completionMessage": "=Price: ${{ $json.price }}\nMonthly payment with taxes: ${{ $json.monthlyPayment }} ({{ $json.term }})\nLoan amount: ${{ $json.loanAmount }}\nTaxes and fees: ${{ $json.taxesAndFees }}\nLoan rates: {{ $json.rates }}\nFive-year cost to own: {{ $json.fiveYearCost }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.form",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        40
      ],
      "id": "a43f4f74-a235-4cbd-8662-3b8d9caec254",
      "name": "Show the deal sheet"
    }
  ],
